Dispatch is a hosted service that emails users summaries of topics they select at an interval of their choosing.
For example, weekly league standings for the NBA or NFL, or the 10 most recent game scores for their team.
A user would provide their email address and select their team/topics they are interested in.
The service sends a verification link to their email to confirm interest and prevent unwanted enrollment.
After verification, users receive emails daily/weekly/biweekly/monthly with their customized digest.
Data retrieved from ESPN/other endpoints is stored in our database to prevent rate limiting of provider endpoints.
Every email should include a link to allow users to update or cancel their subscription, without requiring a password.

Initial sports supported: NBA, NFL, NHL, MLB.
V1 will not require accounts, payments, or passwords.
Target audience: people with low-bandwidth connectivity who cannot access sites like ESPN.com or CNN.
